    staging/upload, mip/target clearing and binding observation use existing GPU/state abstractions.
    Half/full appearance comparisons remain final qualification work; no quality gates were added.
    Sparse current neighborhoods can conservatively reject old detail. The interrupted full GPU
    attempt has no completion receipt and is not counted as passing; earlier candidate receipts do
    not establish correctness of this revised fixture. No appearance or performance benefit is inferred.
  Revised validation -> artifacts/CloudRealtime/phase5/cleanup-commands.json and
