    their original candidate and diagnostic scope; removed tests are not current verification gates.
  Retained regressions -> primary independent scalar clipping/count/positions/weights/density,
    minimum/fractional/maximum/fixed budgets, zero/parallel/corner/entry/exit rays, jitter, exposed and
    connected detail faces, invalid/tiny inputs and exact uniform Beer arithmetic. Secondary cases
    preserve origin-anchored quadratic intervals, short support, budget/distance boundaries, domain
    exits, procedural shared density, solar/lunar composition, octave endpoints, zero-source rejection,
    finite dense saturation and malformed-summary fallback. No approximation-quality assertion exists.
  Matrix removal -> thirteen termination comparison cases and eighteen eight-frame transition smoke
    cases are removed. Their historical observations remain available in prior artifacts. Existing
    TemporalWeightsAndRejectionAreNumericallyObservable and StaticHistoryFollowsBoundedWeightRecurrence
    supply authored acceptance/rejection/weight responses; HistoryRemainsPhysicalAndEmptyMapCannotGhost
    and PhysicalStorageEncodingAndForegroundRulesRemainExact retain encoding and empty-transition
    expectations; NewlyExposedAndOccludedPixelsUseCurrentDepth retains depth-transition expectations.
    These checks cannot pass on neutral cloud output throughout. Strict first-saturated-step,
